==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy|immunology}} The system that differentiates self from non-self and protects the body from foreign substances and pathogenic organisms by producing an [[immune response]]. It includes organs such as the [[thymus]], the [[spleen]] and [[lymph node]]s; tissue such as [[bone marrow]], and lymphoid tissues such as the [[tonsil]]s; cells such as [[lymphocyte]]s including the [[B cell]]s and [[T cell]]s, and cell products such as [[antibody|antibodies]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|adaptive immune system}}

